Package: enterprise-domain-controller
Version: 1.0.72-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jules <jules@example.com>
Depends: cockpit, cockpit-ws, cockpit-system, cockpit-networkmanager, cockpit-packagekit, cockpit-storaged, samba, samba-dsdb-modules, samba-vfs-modules, winbind, libpam-winbind, libnss-winbind, python3-samba, krb5-user, krb5-config, dnsutils, net-tools, acl, attr, chrony, isc-dhcp-server, ufw
Conflicts: systemd-timesyncd, ntp, openntpd
Description: Self-managing enterprise Active Directory domain controller platform.
 Provides Samba AD-DC deployment with 24/7 FSMO-driven service orchestration,
 automatic DHCP/NTP failover, SYSVOL-replicated configuration management,
 and a Cockpit web interface for domain provisioning and monitoring.
